# Test ASCII variants

# Numbers

Soo-saar qor: (2 !=: 3), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (2 <=: 2), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (2 >=: 2), sadar-cusub.

# Strings

Soo-saar qor: (['b'] >=: ['a']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['b'] !=: ['a']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['b'] <=: ['c']), sadar-cusub.

# Bools

Soo-saar qor: (Run !=: Been), sadar-cusub.

# Objects

Soo-saar qor: (Walax cusub !=: Walax cusub), sadar-cusub.

# ASCII list symbol <-:

Soo-saar qor: (Liis <<: 1, ; 2 ; 3) tirada-guud = 3, sadar-cusub.

